    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3221110/extras/f52847123a3dc9cf57e56db139f9e365.poster.avif?t=1754229477\" width=800 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3221110/extras/f52847123a3dc9cf57e56db139f9e365.webm?t=1754229477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3221110/extras/f52847123a3dc9cf57e56db139f9e365.mp4?t=1754229477\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Description:</h2> <br>The elf Freilina was patrolling long-abandoned territories of the forces of evil when she noticed a mysterious castle with lights glowing in its windows. Who could have taken residence in this cursed place? Bandits? Demons? Or something far worse? Armed with a sword and a bow, she ventures inside to uncover the truth and cleanse the castle of its monstrous inhabitants.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3221110/extras/3dc1a6c303c72f4371139dbadf869523.poster.avif?t=1754229477\" width=800 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3221110/extras/3dc1a6c303c72f4371139dbadf869523.webm?t=1754229477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3221110/extras/3dc1a6c303c72f4371139dbadf869523.mp4?t=1754229477\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Elf Adventure: The Lost Castle is an atmospheric anime-style adventure where players explore a dark and mysterious castle filled with traps, enemies, and valuable treasures. Navigate through vast halls and eerie corridors, battle goblins and their leaders, and discover hidden treasure chests containing unique illustrations of Freilina.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3221110/extras/a2f4780a78b5b39562ae631926de9005.poster.avif?t=1754229477\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3221110/extras/a2f4780a78b5b39562ae631926de9005.webm?t=1754229477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3221110/extras/a2f4780a78b5b39562ae631926de9005.mp4?t=1754229477\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2> <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your combat style \u2013 Use a bow for ranged attacks or a sword for close combat.</p></li>  <li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the castle \u2013 Long corridors, hidden rooms, deadly traps.</p></li>  <li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle goblins \u2013 Defeat enemies and face off against their leaders.</p></li>  <li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect treasure chests \u2013 Find valuable rewards and gather all of Freilina's illustrations.</p></li>  <li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep atmosphere \u2013 A dark fantasy setting full of mysteries and dangers.</p></li>  </ul>  <br><br>Are you ready to cleanse the castle of evil and uncover its secrets?",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3221110/extras/f52847123a3dc9cf57e56db139f9e365.poster.avif?t=1754229477\" width=800 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3221110/extras/f52847123a3dc9cf57e56db139f9e365.webm?t=1754229477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3221110/extras/f52847123a3dc9cf57e56db139f9e365.mp4?t=1754229477\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Description:</h2> <br>The elf Freilina was patrolling long-abandoned territories of the forces of evil when she noticed a mysterious castle with lights glowing in its windows. Who could have taken residence in this cursed place? Bandits? Demons? Or something far worse? Armed with a sword and a bow, she ventures inside to uncover the truth and cleanse the castle of its monstrous inhabitants.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3221110/extras/3dc1a6c303c72f4371139dbadf869523.poster.avif?t=1754229477\" width=800 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3221110/extras/3dc1a6c303c72f4371139dbadf869523.webm?t=1754229477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3221110/extras/3dc1a6c303c72f4371139dbadf869523.mp4?t=1754229477\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Elf Adventure: The Lost Castle is an atmospheric anime-style adventure where players explore a dark and mysterious castle filled with traps, enemies, and valuable treasures. Navigate through vast halls and eerie corridors, battle goblins and their leaders, and discover hidden treasure chests containing unique illustrations of Freilina.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3221110/extras/a2f4780a78b5b39562ae631926de9005.poster.avif?t=1754229477\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3221110/extras/a2f4780a78b5b39562ae631926de9005.webm?t=1754229477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3221110/extras/a2f4780a78b5b39562ae631926de9005.mp4?t=1754229477\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2> <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your combat style \u2013 Use a bow for ranged attacks or a sword for close combat.</p></li>  <li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the castle \u2013 Long corridors, hidden rooms, deadly traps.</p></li>  <li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle goblins \u2013 Defeat enemies and face off against their leaders.</p></li>  <li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect treasure chests \u2013 Find valuable rewards and gather all of Freilina's illustrations.</p></li>  <li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep atmosphere \u2013 A dark fantasy setting full of mysteries and dangers.</p></li>  </ul>  <br><br>Are you ready to cleanse the castle of evil and uncover its secrets?",
